      "section_label": "Part I Item 1",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "Available Information",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "Such reports and other information filed by the Company with the SEC are available free of charge at investor.apple.com/investor-relations/sec-filings/default.aspx when such reports are available on the SEC’s website.",
